{"id":"000VF3","title":"NATMOS 1: I'll Keep Holding On","author":"Neokart","solvedCount":11,"difficulty":4,"rating":"N/A","firstSeen":"2026-10-17T17:33:19+00:00","posted":"am 11. Oktober 2026, 07:16 Uhr","rules":"Hi everyone. Two years ago, I started creating puzzles with the series inspired by The Caretaker's album \"Everywhere at the End of Time\". Today marks the start of a series of puzzles inspired by The Caretakers' fan project \"Nowhere at the Millennium of Space\". The design of the grids will refer to the covers made by Barnum Effekt.\n\nRules:\n\n1. Normal sudoku rules apply: Each row, column and 3x3 box contains each digit from 1 to 9 exactly once.\n\n2. Region Sum Line: 3x3 box borders divide the blue line into connected segments with the same sum.\n\n3. Palindrome: Digits on a gray line must be the same read backwards and forwards.\n\n4. Kropki Pairs: A pair of digits joined by a white dot are consecutive. A pair of digits joined by a black dot are in a 1:2 ratio (i.e. one digit is double the other). Not all possible dots are necessarily given.\n\nSolve on SudokuPad\n\nSolve the Cosmetic-lite version on SudokuPad\n\nHave fun solving!\n\nHere you can find the other puzzles in the series:\n\nNATMOS 1: I'll Keep Holding On\nNATMOS 2: Just Out of Reach\n\nOriginal EATEOT series: [1] [2] [3] [4] [5] [6]\nEITBON series: [1] [2] [3] [4] [5] [6]\n[7]","solutionCode":"Column 1 (9 digits, top to bottom)","tags":["Sudoku","Kropki Pairs (Variante)","Palindrome (Variante)","Region Sum Lines (Variante)"],"links":[{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/myao0tla5l","kind":"sudokupad"},{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/nnanfbud29","kind":"sudokupad"}],"data":"","error":null,"settings":{},"link":"https://sudokupad.app/myao0tla5l","linkKind":"sudokupad","summary":{"format":"scl","decoded":true,"rows":9,"cols":9,"cages":0,"hasSolution":true,"features":["lines","overlays"]},"attempts":0,"fetched":"2026-10-17T17:33:19+00:00"}